utions, we equate the coefficients of $x,$ and we equate the constants:\n\n- Equating the coefficients of $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n-s+16=7.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $s,$ we get\n\n$$\ns=9.\n$$\n\n- Equating the constants, we have\n\n$$\n2t=12.\n$$\n\nSolving this equation for $t,$ we get\n\n$$\nt=6.\n$$\n\nFinally, since $s=9$ and $t=6,$ we have\n\n$$\ns+t=9+6=15.\n$$" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477008 1080 "19" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477008 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477008 1083 #uuid "6135c2cd-ed41-554f-a365-6407044708b9" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477009 1080 "11" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477009 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477009 1083 #uuid "64867657-b42b-5877-a7b8-d5f08508e6f0" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477010 1075 #edb/ref 17592186477005 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477010 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477010 1077 "field-1" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477010 1078 #edb/ref 17592186477005 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477010 1079 #uuid "74d8a1c6-b3bb-5405-b5c5-2de709852649" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477011 1080 "12" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477011 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477011 1083 #uuid "7795fc96-bada-5d47-80e4-bcc20f479e5c" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477012 1080 "13" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477012 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477012 1083 #uuid "7f507488-4595-522d-987d-9cb1830b28d4" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477013 1080 "9" 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477013 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535161 17592186045443 true] [17592186477013 1083 #uuid "809ccd9d-fcfa-5f07-b35d-ba3